      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "For identification of ANY food (the full AI brain), add a free key below — Gemini is strongest, Groq also works. Keys are stored only in your iPhone's Keychain, never in the app. With no key, the scanner still works keyless: on-device reading + Open Food Facts web search + reference foods.",
